== Installation ==

You can use one of the both methods for our Twitter Plugin :

**Installation via your Wordpress website**

1. Go to the admin menu 'Plugins' -> 'Install' and search for 'Newest Twitter Widget'
1. Click 'install' and activate the Newest Twitter Plugin
1. Configure your widget in Appearance -> Widgets

**Manual Installation of our Twitter Widget**

1. Upload folder `email-address-protector` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory.
1. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress. ( Twitter Pluginn )
1. Configure plugin in Appearance -> Widgets.

