== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= The Twitter Plugin Bird image doesn't appear! What's happened? =
Sorry, I don't know. Try to uninstall/install the plugin or just pick up the image in the <a href="http://plugins.svn.wordpress.org/juiz-last-tweet-widget/trunk/img/">svn repository</a>.

= Why the Twitter widget show me an error of load for my tweets ? =

First: do you have the latest version of this Twitter plugin?
Second: did you find the settings page, create your Twitter plugin?


= My tweets are not always updated within your Twitter Widget =

Since the v1.1.3, the cache system prefers keep your old tweets instead of displaying a error message due to a lack of tweets inside the Twitter flow. It's a kind of security: old tweets are better than error message :)

= You need to custom the design, hide something in this Twitter Plugin ? =
You can use lot of CSS classes and filters in this Twitter Plugin to help you in you quest :)
See the documentation.html files of our twitter widget inside your plugin folder!